{"updated":"2026-09-03T14:47:41.592Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Yen soars as Bank of Japan tipped to raise interest rates. Elsewhere, please welcome the newest member to our team: The AI agent. And DW. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Russia are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 1.3 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 0.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 1.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 40 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.3 near 84 km SSW of Nikolski, Alaska. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.31,0.37,0.41,0.44,0.49,0.53,0.57,0.59,0.64,0.66,0.71,0.84,0.93,1.08,1.41,1.52,1.57,1.6,1.63,1.67,1.7,1.72,1.74,1.79,1.82,1.89,1.95,2,2.03,2.07,2.11,2.15,2.17,2.24,2.29,2.32,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.5,2.54,2.59,2.65,2.71,2.77,2.89,2.96,3.11,3.13,3.18,3.2,3.27,3.32,3.38,3.5,3.58,3.63,3.7,3.74,3.8,3.84,3.89,3.94,3.96,3.99,4.04,4.06,4.09,4.11,4.16,4.2,4.28,4.34,4.41,4.48,4.54,4.66,4.7,4.75,4.77,4.84,4.96,5.11,5.26,5.64,5.76,5.89,5.93,6.05,6.09,6.27,6.3,6.36,6.44,6.51,6.59,6.63,6.71,6.76,6.82,6.88,6.94,6.99,7.01,7.05,7.11,7.15,7.22,7.29,7.44,7.52,7.62,7.7,7.79,7.85,7.88,7.93,7.98,8.03,8.12,8.16,8.24,8.31,8.38,8.45,8.5,8.54,8.6,8.65,8.71,8.75,8.8,8.84,8.88,8.93,8.96,9.02,9.09,9.18,9.25,9.3,9.38,9.5,10.01,10.12,10.18,10.23,10.28,10.32,10.37,10.4,10.46,10.58,10.6,10.66,10.73,10.77,10.82,10.87,10.91,10.95,10.98,11.03,11.09,11.15,11.2,11.24,11.27,11.31,11.34,11.37,11.39,11.41,11.47,11.52,11.56,11.61,11.68,11.71,11.76,11.82,11.87,11.91,11.96,12.01,12.05,12.07,12.13,12.16,12.19,12.26,12.29,12.33,12.38,12.42,12.48,12.57,12.64,12.74,12.95,13.46,13.5,13.56,13.6,13.66,13.99,14.04,14.11,14.23,14.31,14.41,14.46,14.57,14.65,14.8,14.95,15.05,15.08,15